
### 1. Create an organization
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zomato"
}

### 2. Get all organizations
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orgs

### 3. Get an organization that does not exist
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orgs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 4. Test validation with an empty name
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}
